SUMMARY:Flatlander's Folly
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nHike opens at 8:00 P.M. on Friday\
 , July 17.\n\nMST from Elk Pasture Gap (NC151 & BRP) to Pisgah Inn\, out a
 nd back\, 7 miles\, pace about 2 mph\, less is steep areas. The first part
  of the hike\, to Little Pisgah\, is a 1\,200 foot climb over 1.5 miles. T
 hat's the steep\, slower part. Then it's a steep descent to the Buck Sprin
 gs Lodge site and then on to Pisgah Inn. We'll take our break at the Inn\,
  then return.\n\n7 miles\, 1\,200 feet of steep elevation\, difficult trai
 ls\, not a dog friendly hike.\n\nParking is limited at the trailhead\; we 
 will carpool from the French Broad River overlook.\n\nWith the heat of sum
 mer\, we're hiking at higher elevations for cooler temperatures. This will
  entail longer drives and perhaps more difficult hikes. That's the plan. G
 od is laughing.\n\n**Release of Liability:**\nThe organizer of this trip i
 s a volunteer and not a professional guide. The function of the organizer 
 is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or participate in this event
  you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily agree to assume all risks
  of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising from\, as a result of\, and
  associated with this event. In addition\, you acknowledge that you agree 
 to the Meetup Terms of Service: [https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles
 /360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.](ht
 tps://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e
 385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.)
